# Third-Party License Compliance

This file documents third-party dependencies and their license compatibility
with the project's BSD-3-Clause license.

## All Dependencies (License Summary)

| Dependency              | License        | Type     | BSD-3 Compatible |
|-------------------------|----------------|----------|------------------|
| fmt                     | MIT            | Required | Yes              |
| ASIO (>= 1.29.0)       | BSL-1.0        | Required | Yes              |
| GTest/GMock             | BSD-3-Clause   | Testing  | Yes              |
| Google Benchmark        | Apache-2.0     | Testing  | Yes              |
| libpqxx                 | BSD-3-Clause   | Optional | Yes              |
| libpq (PostgreSQL)      | PostgreSQL     | Optional | Yes              |
| OpenSSL                 | Apache-2.0     | Optional | Yes              |
| SQLite                  | Public Domain  | Optional | Yes              |
| mongo-cxx-driver        | Apache-2.0     | Optional | Yes              |
| hiredis                 | BSD-3-Clause   | Optional | Yes              |
| spdlog                  | MIT            | Optional | Yes              |

All dependencies use permissive licenses (MIT, BSD, Apache-2.0, BSL-1.0,
PostgreSQL, Public Domain). There are no copyleft (GPL, LGPL) dependencies.
